# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
bin/
obj/
*.pdb

# ── IDE / editor ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.swp
*~

# ── Vendored third-party source ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# The game builds against a locally packed, patched Terminal.Gui 2.4.5.1. The package,
# patch and build script are committed (vendor/README.md); the upstream source tree is
# someone else's code and is rebuilt from the v2.4.5 tag plus the patch.
vendor/Terminal.Gui-2.4.5/

# ── Local archives ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
backups/
*.7z
*.zip
*.rar
*.bak

# ── Runtime + player data ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The game writes to %LocalAppData%\AincradTRPG, but the debug log lands next to
# the binary when run from source.
*.log
stderr.txt
__pycache__/
save.json
lifetime_stats.json
profile.json
keybinds.json
deaths/

# ── Assistant tooling and internal working notes ─────────────────────────────
# The project is developed with an AI coding assistant. These files carry local
# machine paths, session state and per-shipment working prose — useful to keep on
# disk, not something to publish. The game code itself is deliberately free of
# them: no assistant references, no personal identifiers, no decision-log noise
# in comments.
# Published: README.md, docs/ARCHITECTURE_NOTES.md, docs/FLOOR_CANON.md, docs/WEAPON_RESEARCH.md,
# docs/README.md, docs/reference/.
.claude/
/CLAUDE.md
/SESSION_STATE.md
docs/HANDOFF.md
docs/PERF.md
docs/UI.md
docs/PLAYER_GUIDE.md
docs/FEATURE_BACKLOG.md
docs/SHIPMENT_LOG.md
docs/DEFERRED.md
docs/archive/

# The personal-identifier list the hygiene check greps for. Kept out of the repository for the
# obvious reason: committing it would publish exactly the strings the check exists to exclude.
Tools/CodeAudit/identifiers.local

# ── OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
